    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a standard-6 (150 µm) nozzle along a 18276 µm G-code path at 22.78 mm/min to fill a 10120 µm footprint at 747 µm line pitch, and report print time, extruded volume, filament mass, fill lines and deposition rate.",
